<title>USA: IPO FILING - Triangle Pharmaceuticals Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Triangle Pharmaceuticals Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    Triangle Pharmaceuticals Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			VIRS.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $7.50-$9.50/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    4.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 4.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  none</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    17,015,238</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Dillon, Read &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  600,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Company is developing new drugs focusing on therapies for the HIV virus, AIDs and hepatitis B virus.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: For general corporate purposes and funding for its drug development program, including pre-clinical and clinical trials, payment for license fees and working capital.</p>
